)ATTR DEFAULT(@}_)
 @ TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE)
 } TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN)
 { TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(TURQ)
 _ TYPE(INPUT)  INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(RED)    CAPS(ON) JUST(LEFT)
 ! TYPE(OUTPUT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) CAPS(OFF) JUST(LEFT)
)BODY
@HELP: Messages -- L to N                       !ISFHMSG                      }
@COMMAND INPUT ===>_ISFHCMD                                                   }
@n LINES PRINTED}, @n PAGES PRINTED
}    PRINT wrote that many lines of output, or pages of the log.
@LOG NOT READABLE
}    SDSF could not get the authorized state to read the log.
@NO ANSWER FROM JES2
}    PR or INIT: JES2 did not answer within a few seconds. Press Enter.
@NO CHARS 'x' FOUND}  (or WORD, PREFIX, SUFFIX)
}    FIND looked through all of the data: the string is not there.
@NO COMMAND PROVIDED
}    / with no command after it.
@NO HELP FOR THIS PANEL YET
}    Help: the panel's help is not there; the contents are shown instead.
@NO SYSLOG FOUND
}    SYSID names another system: SDSF shows only this system's log.
@NOT AUTHORIZED
}    P on the Status panel: SDSF could not get the authorized state.
@NOT AUTHORIZED FOR JOB
}    You may not act on this job: it needs UPDATE access in RAKF (topic 13
}    of the contents).
}
}
}  Enter: next page   PF7: contents   PF3: back to SDSF
)PROC
  &ISFHPFK = .PFKEY
  &ZCONT = ISFHMS5
  &ZUP = ISFHTOC
)END
